---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Write for Us — The Playbook RE"
  description="The Playbook RE publishes practitioner-written strategy for real estate agents. If you've built something that works and want to share it, here's how."
>
  <div class="wfu-hero">
    <div class="wfu-hero-inner">
      <div class="wfu-eyebrow">Contribute</div>
      <h1 class="wfu-title">Write for <em>The Playbook</em>.</h1>
      <p class="wfu-sub">We publish strategy, systems, and scripts from people who've actually used them. Not content marketing. Not thought leadership fluff. Real playbooks from real practitioners.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wfu-body">
    <div class="wfu-body-inner">

      <div class="wfu-standards">
        <h2 class="wfu-h2">What We Publish</h2>
        <p>The Playbook RE has one editorial standard: <strong>it has to work</strong>. Every piece we publish is something a working agent can pick up and use — a system they can implement, a script they can run, a framework they can apply.</p>
        <p>We don't publish opinion pieces, general advice, or market commentary. We publish playbooks.</p>

        <div class="wfu-criteria">
          <div class="wfu-criterion">
            <div class="wfu-criterion-num">01</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Practitioner-written</strong>
              <p>You've used this in a real business. You have results. You can speak to what worked, what didn't, and what someone else needs to know before they try it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="wfu-criterion">
            <div class="wfu-criterion-num">02</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Specific and actionable</strong>
              <p>Step-by-step beats high-level every time. Scripts, frameworks, checklists, and systems over general principles.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="wfu-criterion">
            <div class="wfu-criterion-num">03</div>
            <div>
              <strong>No promotional content</strong>
              <p>We don't publish pieces that promote a product, service, brokerage, or brand — including your own. The playbook is the value. Period.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="wfu-criterion">
            <div class="wfu-criterion-num">04</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Original work</strong>
              <p>Must not be published elsewhere. We don't republish, syndicate, or accept AI-generated content.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wfu-form-wrap">
        <h2 class="wfu-h2">Pitch Us</h2>
        <p>Tell us what you want to write and why you're the right person to write it. Keep it brief — a paragraph or two is enough.</p>

        <form class="wfu-form" id="wfu-form" name="write-for-us" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="write-for-us" />
          <p style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;">
            <label>Leave this field empty: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </p>
          <div class="wfu-field">
            <label class="wfu-label" for="wfu-name">Your name</label>
            <input class="wfu-input" type="text" id="wfu-name" name="name" placeholder="First and last name" />
          </div>
          <div class="wfu-field">
            <label class="wfu-label" for="wfu-email">Email address</label>
            <input class="wfu-input" type="email" id="wfu-email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com" />
          </div>
          <div class="wfu-field">
            <label class="wfu-label" for="wfu-role">Your role</label>
            <input class="wfu-input" type="text" id="wfu-role" name="role" placeholder="e.g. Realtor, Team Lead, Broker" />
          </div>
          <div class="wfu-field">
            <label class="wfu-label" for="wfu-topic">Proposed topic / working title</label>
            <input class="wfu-input" type="text" id="wfu-topic" name="topic" placeholder="What's the playbook?" />
          </div>
          <div class="wfu-field">
            <label class="wfu-label" for="wfu-pitch">Your pitch</label>
            <textarea class="wfu-input wfu-textarea" id="wfu-pitch" name="pitch" placeholder="What does this piece cover? Why are you the right person to write it? What results have you seen using this in your own business?"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button class="wfu-submit" type="submit">Submit Your Pitch →</button>
        </form>

        <div class="wfu-confirm" id="wfu-confirm">
          <div class="wfu-confirm-icon">✓</div>
          <div class="wfu-confirm-title">Pitch received.</div>
          <p class="wfu-confirm-text">We review every submission. If it's a fit, someone will be in touch within two weeks. If it's not, we won't follow up — but we appreciate you reaching out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var form = document.getElementById('wfu-form');
    var confirm = document.getElementById('wfu-confirm');
    if (!form) return;

    function flag(el) {
      if (!el) return;
      el.focus();
      el.style.borderColor = '#e00055';
      setTimeout(function () { el.style.borderColor = ''; }, 1200);
    }
    function encode(data) {
      return Object.keys(data).map(function (k) {
        return encodeURIComponent(k) + '=' + encodeURIComponent(data[k]);
      }).join('&');
    }

    form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var name  = document.getElementById('wfu-name');
      var email = document.getElementById('wfu-email');
      var role  = document.getElementById('wfu-role');
      var topic = document.getElementById('wfu-topic');
      var pitch = document.getElementById('wfu-pitch');

      if (!name.value.trim()) { flag(name); return; }
      if (!email.value.trim() || !email.value.includes('@')) { flag(email); return; }
      if (!pitch.value.trim()) { flag(pitch); return; }

      var hp = form.querySelector('[name="bot-field"]');
      var body = {
        'form-name': 'write-for-us',
        name: name.value.trim(),
        email: email.value.trim(),
        role: role.value.trim(),
        topic: topic.value.trim(),
        pitch: pitch.value.trim(),
        'bot-field': hp ? hp.value : '',
      };

      // Show confirmation immediately; send the pitch to Netlify Forms in the
      // background (graceful — confirmation stands even if it fails locally).
      form.style.display = 'none';
      if (confirm) confirm.style.display = 'block';
      fetch('/', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },
        body: encode(body),
      }).catch(function (err) { console.warn('[write-for-us] submit failed:', err); });
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .wfu-hero { background: var(--black); border-bottom: 1px solid #1f1f1f; }
  .wfu-hero-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 40px 64px; }
  .wfu-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .wfu-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 80px; line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .wfu-title em { color: var(--yellow); font-style: normal; }
  .wfu-sub {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65;
    color: #666; max-width: 600px;
  }

  /* Body */
  .wfu-body { background: var(--off-white); }
  .wfu-body-inner {
    max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 40px 80px;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start;
  }
  .wfu-h2 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .wfu-standards p, .wfu-form-wrap p {
    font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--charcoal); margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .wfu-standards strong { color: var(--black); font-weight: 600; }

  /* Criteria list */
  .wfu-criteria { margin-top: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
  .wfu-criterion { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .wfu-criterion-num {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 28px; color: var(--yellow);
    line-height: 1; flex-shrink: 0; width: 32px;
  }
  .wfu-criterion strong { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--black); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .wfu-criterion p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: #666; margin: 0; }

  /* Form */
  .wfu-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .wfu-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .wfu-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gray);
  }
  .wfu-input {
    background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--charcoal); outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .wfu-input:focus { border-color: var(--yellow); }
  .wfu-input::placeholder { color: #bbb; }
  .wfu-textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 120px; }
  .wfu-submit {
    background: var(--black); color: var(--yellow);
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 16px 32px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    align-self: flex-start; transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  .wfu-submit:hover { background: #222; }

  /* Confirm */
  .wfu-confirm { display: none; text-align: center; padding: 40px 0; }
  .wfu-confirm-icon {
    width: 52px; height: 52px; background: var(--yellow);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 20px; font-size: 22px;
  }
  .wfu-confirm-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 36px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .wfu-confirm-text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--charcoal); max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto; }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .wfu-body-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .wfu-title { font-size: 60px; }
    .wfu-hero-inner, .wfu-body-inner { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
  }
</style>
